{"seq":3,"slug":"consumer-decision-process","title":"消费者决策过程","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/management/marketing/marketing-principles-consumer-behavior/consumer-decision-process","wordCount":1480,"readingTime":6,"html":"<h1 id=\"消费者决策过程\">消费者决策过程</h1><p>你有没有想过，从&quot;突然觉得需要一双跑鞋&quot;到&quot;在购物车里下单&quot;，再到&quot;穿了三个月后决定要不要回购同款&quot;，你的大脑其实走完了一条相当固定的流水线？这一节我们就把这条流水线拆开，看看每个环节里营销人能在哪里使上劲。</p>\n<h2 id=\"知识要点\">知识要点</h2><ul>\n<li>经典的消费者决策包含五个阶段：问题识别、信息搜集、方案评估、购买决策、购后行为。</li>\n<li>不是每次购买都走完五步——日常小额、低风险的购买往往跳过中间环节，形成&quot;习惯性购买&quot;。</li>\n<li>信息搜集分内部（凭记忆和经验）和外部（搜索、问朋友、看评价），数字时代外部搜集的权重急剧上升。</li>\n<li>方案评估阶段，消费者会用一组&quot;评价标准&quot;给候选打分，但这些标准的权重高度个人化、且常被营销引导。</li>\n<li>购后阶段的&quot;认知失调&quot;（买完后悔/怀疑）若处理不好，会直接杀死复购和口碑。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"详细讲解\">详细讲解</h2><p>先看这条经典的五阶段链路：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;    A[问题识别] --&gt; B[信息搜集]&#10;    B --&gt; C[方案评估]&#10;    C --&gt; D[购买决策]&#10;    D --&gt; E[购后行为]&#10;    E -.反馈.-&gt; A\">graph LR\n    A[问题识别] --&gt; B[信息搜集]\n    B --&gt; C[方案评估]\n    C --&gt; D[购买决策]\n    D --&gt; E[购后行为]\n    E -.反馈.-&gt; A</pre><p><strong>问题识别</strong>是一切的起点：消费者感知到&quot;现实状态&quot;和&quot;理想状态&quot;之间出现了缺口。这个缺口可能来自内部（鞋底磨破了），也可能被外部刺激唤起（刷到一条跑步博主的视频）。营销的第一仗，往往就是制造或放大这种&quot;缺口感&quot;——让你意识到&quot;原来我还不够好/还少点什么&quot;。</p>\n<p><strong>信息搜集</strong>阶段，人会先翻&quot;内部记忆&quot;：我以前买过什么牌子、印象如何。当内部信息不够时才转向外部。这里有个重大变化值得记住：到 2026 年，越来越多的人把生成式 AI 工具当成搜索入口，据预测使用 AI 工具搜索的网民将从约 1500 万增长到 2029 年的 7200 万。这意味着信息搜集的&quot;第一现场&quot;正在从传统搜索结果页，转向 AI 直接给出的答案。这也催生了&quot;生成式引擎优化（GEO）&quot;——品牌开始研究怎么让自己被 AI 的回答引用，而不仅仅是被搜索引擎排名。</p>\n<p><strong>方案评估</strong>阶段，消费者会锁定几个候选（叫&quot;考虑集&quot;），然后用一组标准打分。你可以把它想象成一个简化的加权评分：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>S</mi><mi>c</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>e</mi><mo>=</mo><munderover><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>n</mi></munderover><msub><mi>w</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>⋅</mo><msub><mi>a</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Score = \\sum_{i=1}^{n} w_i \\cdot a_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">cor</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.9291em;vertical-align:-1.2777em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.6514em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.8723em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">=</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\">∑</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-4.3em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.2777em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0269em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>a</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">a_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是某产品在第 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>i</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6595em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span></span></span></span></span> 个属性上的表现，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>w</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">w_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0269em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是这个属性对该消费者的权重。关键洞察是：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>w</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">w_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0269em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 因人而异，而且能被营销影响。比如手机厂商通过广告反复强调&quot;拍照&quot;，就是在悄悄抬高拍照这个属性的 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>w</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">w_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0269em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，从而让自己的强项变得更&quot;重要&quot;。</p>\n<p><strong>购买决策</strong>看似就是下单那一下，但中间还可能被两类因素打断：一是别人的态度（伴侣说&quot;这个不好看&quot;），二是意外情境（结账时发现要额外付运费）。所以购物车流失率高，常常不是产品问题，而是临门一脚的体验问题。</p>\n<p><strong>购后行为</strong>最容易被新手忽略，却是复购和口碑的命脉。买完之后，人会重新评估这笔交易值不值，如果实际体验低于期望，就会产生&quot;认知失调&quot;——一种&quot;我是不是买亏了&quot;的不适感。好的品牌会主动出手缓解：发一封贴心的使用指南、给个无忧退换承诺、邀请你晒单返券。这些动作的本质，是把购后阶段重新拉回到正向体验，避免负面口碑扩散。</p>\n<p>值得一提的是，并非所有购买都这么&quot;重&quot;。买瓶水、买包纸巾这类低参与度商品，人会直接跳到购买，靠的是习惯和品牌熟悉度。所以五阶段模型更适合解释高参与度、高风险的购买（买房、买车、报课程），用它去套&quot;随手买瓶水&quot;就显得小题大做了。</p>\n<h2 id=\"练习与思考\">练习与思考</h2><ol>\n<li>挑一次你近期的&quot;大额购买&quot;，逐一对照五个阶段，标出每个阶段你分别受了哪些信息或人的影响。</li>\n<li>观察一个电商商品详情页，找出页面上分别在为&quot;信息搜集&quot;&quot;方案评估&quot;&quot;缓解购后失调&quot;服务的设计元素（如评价区、对比表、七天无理由）。</li>\n<li>思考题：如果你是品牌方，发现大量用户在&quot;方案评估&quot;阶段流失到竞品，你会优先调整 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>w</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">w_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0269em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>（改变用户看重的标准）还是 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>a</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">a_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>（提升自己的属性表现）？为什么？</li>\n</ol>\n<h2 id=\"拓展阅读\">拓展阅读</h2><ul>\n<li>科特勒《营销管理》中关于&quot;购买决策过程&quot;的章节，给出了更细的影响因素分类（文化、社会、个人、心理）。</li>\n<li>留意你用的购物 App 在你&quot;放弃购物车&quot;后是怎么追回你的（推送、短信、优惠券）——这是购买决策被打断后的典型补救。</li>\n<li>关注&quot;生成式引擎优化（GEO）&quot;的最新讨论，它正在重塑信息搜集阶段的玩法，是连接本章与第四章数字营销的桥梁。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>这一节我们走完了消费者从&quot;意识到缺口&quot;到&quot;购后回评&quot;的完整心路。记住三件事：决策是分阶段的，但低参与度购买会抄近路；评估阶段的属性权重 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>w</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">w_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0269em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是营销可以撬动的杠杆；购后阶段决定复购和口碑，绝不能省。带着这套对&quot;人怎么买&quot;的理解，下一章我们升一个维度，看看企业如何通过市场调研和 STP，系统地决定&quot;到底服务谁、在他心里站什么位置&quot;。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"消费者决策过程","id":"消费者决策过程"},{"level":2,"text":"知识要点","id":"知识要点"},{"level":2,"text":"详细讲解","id":"详细讲解"},{"level":2,"text":"练习与思考","id":"练习与思考"},{"level":2,"text":"拓展阅读","id":"拓展阅读"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"需要、欲望与价值交换","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/management/marketing/marketing-principles-consumer-behavior/needs-wants-value-exchange"},"next":{"title":"市场调研方法","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/management/marketing/market-research-stp/market-research-methods"}}